<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>PulseReach — Donor Mobilisation</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=23">
</head>
<body class="landing">
<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark"><img src="/images/pulsereach-logo.png" alt="PulseReach logo"></span> PulseReach</a>
  <nav>
    <a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#intelligence">Intelligence</a>
    <a href="/login">Organizer sign in</a><a href="/donor/login">Donor Login</a>
    <a class="btn btn-dark" href="/register-organizer">Create organizer account</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main>
  <section class="hero wrap hero-refresh">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">INTELLIGENT BLOOD DONATION MOBILISATION</div>
      <h1>Turn registrations into <span>real turnout.</span></h1>
      <p>One workspace for blood-drive organisers to register donors, manage consent, personalise reminders and understand expected attendance.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/login">Open organiser workspace →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/donor/login">Donor Login</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/donor/register">Create donor account</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-trust"><span>✓ Consent-first</span><span>✓ Clinician-led check-up</span><span>✓ Timely reminders</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual-refresh">
      <img src="/images/pulsereach-donation-hero.jpg" alt="Blood donation camp">
      <span class="visual-chip"><i></i> BLOOD DONATION CAMP</span>
      <div class="visual-caption">PulseReach</div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap live-strip-refresh">
    <div class="live-strip-head"><span>LIVE WORKSPACE</span><b><i></i> READY</b></div>
    <% if (latestDrive) { %>
      <div class="live-grid"><div><h3><%= latestDrive.name %></h3><p><%= new Date(latestDrive.date).toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}) %> · <%= latestDrive.venue %></p></div>
      <div class="live-metrics"><div><strong><%= latestDrive.registrationCount %></strong><span>registered</span></div><div><strong><%= latestDrive.predicted %>%</strong><span>predicted turnout</span></div><div><strong><%= latestDrive.targetCount %></strong><span>target</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="progress"><i style="width:<%= latestDrive.predicted %>%"></i></div>
    <% } else { %>
      <div class="live-grid"><div><h3>No blood donation drive yet</h3><p>Create your first drive from the organiser dashboard.</p></div><div class="live-metrics"><div><strong>0</strong><span>registered</span></div><div><strong>0%</strong><span>predicted turnout</span></div><div><strong>0</strong><span>target</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="progress"><i style="width:0%"></i></div>
    <% } %>
  </section>
  <section id="how" class="section wrap"><div class="section-title"><span>01</span><div><h2>Everything around the drive, in one place.</h2><p>Built for mobilisation and coordination — not medical screening.</p></div></div><div class="feature-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Create drives</h3><p>Set the event, venue, target count and official screening information.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Share & register</h3><p>Give participants a mobile-friendly link and QR-based registration flow.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Communicate</h3><p>Track consent and tailor reminders by language and response stage.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Track turnout</h3><p>Compare predicted attendance with the attendance recorded on the day.</p></article></div></section>
  <section id="intelligence" class="section dark-section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 · CORE INTELLIGENCE</div><h2>Know where your turnout stands before the drive begins.</h2><p>Each registrant receives a transparent prototype attendance score based on confirmation, engagement, response behaviour and previous participation signals.</p></div><div class="score-panel"><div class="score"><strong><%= latestDrive ? latestDrive.predicted : 0 %>%</strong><span>Predicted attendance</span></div><div class="bars"><div><span>Confirmed</span><i style="width:<%= latestDrive ? confirmedRate : 0 %>%"></i></div><div><span>Reminder engagement</span><i style="width:<%= latestDrive ? engagedRate : 0 %>%"></i></div><div><span>Response behaviour</span><i style="width:<%= latestDrive ? confirmedRate : 0 %>%"></i></div><div><span>Previous participation</span><i style="width:<%= latestDrive ? Math.min(100, Math.round((participants.filter(p => p.previousParticipation).length / Math.max(participants.length,1))*100)) : 0 %>%"></i></div></div></div></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer wrap"><b>PulseReach</b><span>Mobilisation & administrative coordination for blood donation drives.</span></footer>
<script src="/js/pulsereach-assistant.js?v=1"></script>
</body></html>
